From b4caadb286018a9daa2108c653d097b6a1f19533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: XCH27 <49464716+XCH27@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 03:20:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] A Skill market beside the Plugin market (OV-103)

Standalone Skills get their own market: sources added there are read as
Skill collections (every SKILL.md folder installs as one Skill, even next
to a repository's own plugin catalog), and a plain Skill repository added
in the Plugin market lands there too. The Plugin market keeps plugins, MCP
servers and plugins that bundle Skills. Both share the store view with a
market kind carried through back/forward history; the Skill market has its
own sidebar entry, title, add-source dialog (Anthropic skills preset),
empty state and source names, without public/personal segments.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
